1 NAME Cangjin /博爾濟吉特/
2 GIVN Cangjin
2 SURN 博爾濟吉特
2 _MARNM [Borjigit]
1 NAME 津 /博爾濟吉特/ 二
2 GIVN 津
2 SURN 博爾濟吉特
2 NSFX 二
2 _MARNM 倉
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE BEF 1684
1 OCCU Prince (Wang) 
2 DATE 1693
2 PLAC Qing Dynasty of the Imperial China
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1732
1 OCCU Prince (Wang) of the Ongniut Right Banner
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} In the 45th year of Emperor Kangxi (1706), the eighth princess, who was 20 years old, was named Princess Heshuo Wenke, and she married Cangjin, the king of Duling County, Wengniute, of the Mongolian Bolzijit family
2 CONC  .
2 CONT
2 CONT Cangjin's first name was Bandi, the second son of Biligun Dalai, the king of Duling County, Wengniu Special Department , and the fourth daughter of Prince Azige (Dorgon's brother), the grandmother, who was born in the 32nd year of
2 CONC  Kangxi (1693). Fengjun Wang. The name "Bandi" should be very popular in Mongolia . There were 5 concubines named "Bandi" in the Qing Dynasty . Xu Kangxi felt that the rate of repeating the name of "Bandi" was too high, so he gave
2 CONC  the name Cangjin directly, and the emperor gave the name to his ministers It can be regarded as a great grace and honor.
2 CONT
2 CONT The Wengniu Special Department is located outside Gubeikou, 760 miles from the capital, and relatively close to Rehe. It belongs to the Zhaowuda League, one of the six Mongolian Leagues in southern Mongolia. Before that, the main 
2 CONC tribes in the Zhaowuda League were Bahrain, Aohan and Zarut both married royal princesses one after another. Among the more than 40 Mongolian kings in Mongolia at that time, the Wengniute Right Wing Banner also had strong strength
2 CONC .
2 CONT
2 CONT First, in order to balance the relationship between the various ministries of the Zhaowuda League, and more importantly, to favor and win over, Kangxi decided to marry Princess Wen Ke to the Wengniu Special Department.
2 CONT
2 CONT Not only that, when the princess got married in July, Kangxi also personally escorted her to the place where she was married, and also visited the location of the Wengniu Te Department. It was extremely glorious, greeted with a gr
2 CONC and ceremony, and cheers resounded through the grassland. On this day, Kangxi stayed at the residence of Princess Heshuo Wenke.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://inf.news/en/history/a86d116ceae557533350e7ffa5d9483d.html
